#: logical-address-autocomplete-for-formidable-forms.php
msgid "Add modern Google Places suggestions to Formidable Forms. Dedicated Address field, native Address autofill, country/type/language controls, location bias, required selection and admin entry map links. Requires Formidable Forms and your own Google API key."
